# NETCONF over SSH on the PE (owner: 02-device-simulator; added by 10-clixon-controller), port 830 (RFC 6242).
# One user, controller: the Clixon controller's key (its public half comes from the shared volume controller-keys,
# written by the controller; never baked into the image), from the controller's address only (contract section 4).
# Every session is clixon_netconf: the subsystem below, and ForceCommand for anything else; the user's login shell is
# the same NETCONF session (devices/netconf-session). Not published on the host: labnet only.
Port 830
AddressFamily inet
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
HostKey /var/lib/netsim/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/sshd.pid

AllowUsers controller@172.30.10.70
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/netsim/keys/controller.pub
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PermitRootLogin no
UsePAM no
StrictModes yes

Subsystem netconf /opt/clixon/bin/clixon_netconf -f /etc/clixon.xml -l e
ForceCommand /usr/local/bin/netconf-session
DisableForwarding yes
PermitTTY no
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserRC no
PermitUserEnvironment no

LoginGraceTime 10
ClientAliveInterval 30
ClientAliveCountMax 2
LogLevel INFO
